    "text":"Nobody makes equipment like we do. Nobody makes the ammunition, the weapons, the missiles, the planes, none of it. And if they do, the American sailor stands ready to crush them and sink them and wreck them and blast them into oblivion. Right? And that's a terrible statement for me to make. That's the end of it. Because everybody said that I should immediately get the Nobel Peace award.",
