    "text":"I love stopping wars. And, uh, sort of interesting. I'll be the only president. I don't think any president stopped one war. I stopped eight wars in eight months. Did I get a Nobel Prize? No. (laughing) I said, \"Can you believe it?\" Even I said, \"Yeah, that's an impossible one.\" But, uh, it's all right. I suspect they think next year will be better.",
