    "place":"Joint Base Andrews, MD",
    "duration":26.0,
    "mentions":2.0,
    "text":"Now, in all fairness to the Nobel Committee, uh, I was -- it was for 19- it was for 2024, and this was picked for 2024. But there are those that say you could make an exception because a lot of things happened during '25 that are -- that are done and complete and great. Um, but I did this not for Nobel. I did this for -- I did this for saving lives.",
