    "duration":24.0,
    "mentions":1.0,
    "text":"Everyone says that I should get the Nobel Peace Prize for each one of these achievements. But for me, the real prize will be the sons and daughters who live to grow up with their mothers and fathers because millions of people are no longer being killed in endless and unglorious [sic] wars. What I care about is not winning prizes, it's saving lives.",
