    "type":"Press Gaggle",
    "media":"Video",
    "place":"Morristown, NJ",
    "duration":19.0,
    "mentions":2.0,
    "text":"Well, they should give me the Nobel Prize for Rwanda, and, uh, if you look, the Congo, or you could say Serbia, Kosovo. You could say a lot of them. You could say, uh, I mean, the big one is India and Pakistan. You could -- I should have gotten it four or five times. I should get it for the, uh, I would think the Abraham Accords would be a good one too.",
