    "text":"Anyway, let's have a good -- they call it a lifting. They also use another word, but I'm not going to use that word. You know what that is, the word? It starts with an E. You know what the word is? If I ever used it, I'd be run out of town by you people. All right. So enjoy it. Doug, you're going to get some good -- he's going to win another Nobel Prize, I think, for this picture.",
