    "type":"Social Media",
    "media":"Social Media",
    "place":"Social Media",
    "duration":0.0,
    "mentions":0.0,
    "text":"Wow! What a great story of the Trump Administration\u2019s success. Where are the Nobel Peace Prizes?  \u201cJared Kushner's Unconventional Take on Our Most Unconventional President\u201d https:\/\/www. newsweek.com\/jared-kushners-un conventional-take-our-most-unconventional-president-1737769",
